<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3-yr govt bond yield falls to 17.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3-yr govt bond yield falls to 17.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on thelatest issue of Hungary's three-year government bonds dropped to 17.23 percent from 19.19 percent set at an auction one month ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    2000/D BOND</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    10,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     38.252.93 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   9,999.98 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		11,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  17.23 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		  104.37 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
